R&D investment → defense contracts with long-term visibility → recurring FCF growth → reinvested into new programs or EV expansion. GD’s ability to leverage its expertise in both defense and EV sectors creates a self-reinforcing loop. **Durability Verdict:** High, given its dual-sector exposure and strong execution track record.

